@startuml
title EmbeddedSystemX behavior
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam stateBorderColor #334155
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam nodesep 55
skinparam ranksep 65
hide empty description

[*] --> PowerOnSelfTest
PowerOnSelfTest : entry / systemSelftest
PowerOnSelfTest --> Initializing : SelftestOk
PowerOnSelfTest --> Failure : SelfTestFailed(errorNo) / recordFailure(errorNo)
Initializing : entry / startInitializing
Initializing --> Operational : Initialized
Failure : entry / display(errorNo)
Failure --> PowerOnSelfTest : Restart
Failure --> [*] : Exit

state Operational {
    [*] --> Ready
    Ready -right-> Configuration : Configure
    Configuration : entry / readConfigurationInfo
    Configuration : ConfigX / PerformConfigurationX
    Configuration -left-> Ready : ConfigurationEnded
    Ready --> RealTimeLoop : Start\n/ run
    RealTimeLoop --> Ready : Stop

    state RealTimeLoop {
        [*] --> Mode1
        Mode1 : eventX / responseM1eventX
        Mode2 : eventX / responseM2eventX
        Mode1 -right-> Mode2 : chMode2
        Mode2 -left-> Mode1 : chMode1
    }
}
Operational --> PowerOnSelfTest : Restart

note bottom of Operational
  Mode changes are queued and executed by the worker.
  The event caller waits for completion.
  Unaccepted events print a message and preserve the state.
  Entry and response actions currently print simulated results.
end note
@enduml
